Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ef57fc33-b90c-32ea-aea9-5564b9201e29.xml</text>
